  "cells": [
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "# Using the Wolfram alfa LLM api as a Tool com Claude\nIn este recipe, we'll show you como para integrate the Wolfram alfa LLM api as a tool para Claude para use. Claude will be able para enviar queries para the Wolfram alfa api e receber computed responses, qual isso can então use para provide answers para usuário questions."
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "## Step 1: definir up the environment\nprimeiro, let's instalar the obrigatório libraries e definir up the Anthropic api cliente. We also will need para definir our APP ID para using WolframAlpha. You can sign up e criar a novo App ID para este projeto para free [aqui](https://developer.wolframalpha.com/access)."
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "execution_count": 10,
      "metadata": {},
      "outputs": [],
      "source": [
        "from anthropic importar Anthropic\n",
        "importar requests\n",
        "importar urllib.parse\n",
        "importar json\n",
        "\n",
        "client = Anthropic()\n",
        "\n",
        "# substituir 'YOUR_APP_ID' with your actual Wolfram Alpha AppID\n",
        "WOLFRAM_APP_ID = 'YOUR_APP_ID'"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "## Step 2: Define the Wolfram alfa LLM api tool\nWe'll define a tool aquele allows Claude para enviar queries para the Wolfram alfa LLM api e receber the computed resposta."
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "execution_count": nulo,
      "metadata": {},
      "outputs": [],
      "source": [
        "def wolfram_alpha_query(query):    \n",
        "    # URL-codificar the query\n",
        "    encoded_query = urllib.parse.quote(query)\n",
        "    \n",
        "    # Make a request to the Wolfram Alpha LLM api\n",
        "    url = f'https://www.wolframalpha.com/api/v1/llm-api?entrada={encoded_query}&appid={WOLFRAM_APP_ID}'\n",
        "    response = requests.obter(url)\n",
        "    \n",
        "    se response.status_code == 200:\n",
        "        retornar response.text\n",
        "    senão:\n",
        "        retornar f\"Erro: {response.status_code}: {response.text}\"\n",
        "\n",
        "tools = [\n",
        "    {\n",
        "        \"nome\": \"wolfram_alpha\",\n",
        "        \"Descrição\": \"A tool that allows querying the Wolfram Alpha knowledge base. Useful para mathematical calculations, scientific data, and general knowledge questions.\",\n",
        "        \"input_schema\": {\n",
        "            \"tipo\": \"objeto\",\n",
        "            \"Propriedades\": {\n",
        "                \"search_query\": {\n",
        "                    \"tipo\": \"texto\",\n",
        "                    \"Descrição\": \"The query to send to the Wolfram Alpha api.\"\n",
        "                }\n",
        "            },\n",
        "            \"required\": [\"query\"]\n",
        "        }\n",
        "    }\n",
        "]"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "In este code, we define a wolfram_alpha_query função aquele takes a query as entrada, URL-encodes isso, e sends a requisição para the Wolfram alfa LLM api using the provided AppID. The função retorna the computed resposta de the api se the requisição is successful, ou an erro message se ali's an problema.\n\nWe então define the wolfram_alpha tool com an entrada schema aquele expects a single query property of tipo texto.\n"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "## Step 3: Interact com Claude\nagora, let's see como Claude can interact com the Wolfram alfa tool para answer usuário questions."
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "execution_count": 27,
      "metadata": {},
      "outputs": [],
      "source": [
        "def process_tool_call(tool_name, tool_input):\n",
        "    se tool_name == \"wolfram_alpha\":\n",
        "        retornar wolfram_alpha_query(tool_input[\"search_query\"])\n",
        "\n",
        "def chat_with_claude(user_message):\n",
        "    imprimir(f\"\\n{'='*50}\\nUser Message: {user_message}\\n{'='*50}\")\n",
        "    prompt = f\"\"\"Here is a question: {user_message}. Please use the Wolfram Alpha tool to answer isso. Do not reflect on the quality of the returned search results in your response.\"\"\"\n",
        "\n",
        "    message = client.beta.tools.messages.create(\n",
        "        model=MODEL_NAME,\n",
        "        max_tokens=4096,\n",
        "        tools=tools,\n",
        "        messages=[{\"role\": \"user\", \"content\": prompt}]\n",
        "    )\n",
        "    \n",
        "    imprimir(f\"\\nInitial Response:\")\n",
        "    imprimir(f\"Stop Reason: {message.stop_reason}\")\n",
        "    imprimir(f\"Content: {message.content}\")\n",
        "    \n",
        "    se message.stop_reason == \"tool_use\":\n",
        "        tool_use = next(block para block in message.content se block.tipo == \"tool_use\")\n",
        "        tool_name = tool_use.nome\n",
        "        tool_input = tool_use.entrada\n",
        "        \n",
        "        imprimir(f\"\\nTool Used: {tool_name}\")\n",
        "        imprimir(f\"Tool entrada:\")\n",
        "        imprimir(json.dumps(tool_input, indent=2))\n",
        "        \n",
        "        tool_result = process_tool_call(tool_name, tool_input)\n",
        "        \n",
        "        imprimir(f\"\\nTool Result:\")\n",
        "        imprimir(str(json.dumps(tool_result, indent=2)))\n",
        "    \n",
        "        \n",
        "        response = client.beta.tools.messages.create(\n",
        "            model=MODEL_NAME,\n",
        "            max_tokens=2000,\n",
        "            tools=tools,\n",
        "            messages=[\n",
        "                {\"role\": \"user\", \"content\": prompt},\n",
        "                {\"role\": \"assistant\", \"content\": message.content},\n",
        "                {\n",
        "                    \"role\": \"user\",\n",
        "                    \"content\": [\n",
        "                        {\n",
        "                            \"tipo\": \"tool_result\",\n",
        "                            \"tool_use_id\": tool_use.id,\n",
        "                            \"content\": str(tool_result)\n",
        "                        }\n",
        "                    ]\n",
        "                }\n",
        "            ]\n",
        "        )\n",
        "        \n",
        "        imprimir(f\"\\nResponse:\")\n",
        "        imprimir(f\"Stop Reason: {response.stop_reason}\")\n",
        "        imprimir(f\"Content: {response.content}\")\n",
        "    senão:\n",
        "        response = message\n",
        "    \n",
        "    final_response = None\n",
        "    para block in response.content:\n",
        "        se hasattr(block, 'text'):\n",
        "            final_response = block.text\n",
        "            parar\n",
        "    \n",
        "    imprimir(f\"\\nFinal Response: {final_response}\")\n",
        "    \n",
        "    retornar final_response"
      ]
    },
    {
